# The other half of Wrath of the Bloodmane's cost change (CR 601.2f): with no legendary creature, its {2}{R} is not
# reduced, so the two Moxen that paid the {1}{R} in the legendary case cannot cast it and the spell is not offered.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Wrath of the Bloodmane
Swamp x5
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Ornithopter
Swamp x18

[Actions]
[T1 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
